ok   request parsed before shutdown
ok   grace expired: parsed request interrupted before handler starts
ok   registration after shutdown: explicit 503 and handler not started
ok   request parsed before grace ends is served
ok   shutdown wakes reaper after last connection is removed
ok   server can restart after shutdown
